dictine", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Brandy snifter", :strInstructionsDE "Den Bourbon und den Benediktiner in ein Brandyglas geben.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 nil, :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Dans un shaker à moitié rempli de glaçons, mélanger le courbon et la Bénédictine. Agiter et filtrer dans un verre à cocktail. Décorer avec le zeste de citron.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "In a shaker half-filled with ice cubes combine the courbon and Benedictine. Shake and strain into a cocktail glass. Garnish with the lemon twist.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "3 oz ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Kentucky Colonel", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/utqwpu1478820348.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1 twist of ", :strInstructionsES "En una coctelera llena hasta la mitad con cubitos de hielo, combinar el courbon y el Benedictine. Agitar y colar en una copa de cóctel. Decorar con el twist de limón.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Bourbon", :idDrink "11604", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "在裝有半杯冰塊的搖酒壺中，將庫本和本篤會混合在一起。搖勻後濾入雞尾酒杯。用檸檬片裝飾。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "在装有半杯冰块的摇酒壶中，将库本和本笃会混合在一起。摇匀并滤入鸡尾酒杯。用柠檬片装饰。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "In uno shaker riempito a metà con cubetti di ghiaccio unire il courbon e il benedettino.Shakerare e filtrare in una coppetta da cocktail. Guarnire con la scorza di limone.", :strMeasure2 "1/2 oz ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2016-11-10 23:25:48", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Ordinary Drink", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Benedictine", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Cocktail glass", :strInstructionsDE "In einem Shaker, der halb mit Eiswürfeln gefüllt ist, den Bourbon und den Benediktiner vermengen. Schütteln und in ein Cocktailglas abseihen. Mit der Zitronenscheibe garnieren.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Lemon peel", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Remplissez d'abord la moitié du verre à shot avec le kool-aid. Placez ensuite une serviette en papier sur le dessus du verre et versez lentement la vodka. Si vous le faites correctement, vous devriez pouvoir voir que les deux liquides sont séparés, avec la vodka dessus. Maintenant, claque-le ! La dernière chose que vous goûterez est le kool-aid.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Fill half the shot glass with the kool-aid first. Then put a paper towel over the top of the glass and slowly pour in the vodka. If you do it right, you should be able to see that the two liquids are separated, with the vodka on top. Now slam it! The last thing you'll taste is the kool-aid.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "1/2 oz Grape ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Kool-Aid Slammer", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/kugu2m1504735473.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 nil, :strInstructionsES "Primero llena la mitad del vaso de chupito con kool-aid. Luego, coloca una toalla de papel sobre la parte superior del vaso y vierte lentamente el vodka. Si lo haces bien, deberías poder ver que los dos líquidos están separados, con el vodka encima. ¡Ahora golpéalo! Lo último que probarás es el kool-aid.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Kool-Aid", :idDrink "14446", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "首先將酷愛飲料裝滿半個玻璃杯。然後將紙巾放在玻璃杯頂部，慢慢倒入伏特加。如果操作正確，您應該可以看到兩種液體分開，伏特加在上面。現在猛擊它！你最後嚐到的是酷愛飲料。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "首先将酷爱饮料装满半个玻璃杯。然后将纸巾放在玻璃杯顶部，慢慢倒入伏特加。如果操作正确，您应该能够看到两种液体分开，伏特加在上面。现在猛击它！你最后尝到的是酷爱饮料。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Riempi prima metà del bicchierino con il kool-aid.\r\nQuindi mettere un tovagliolo di carta sulla parte superiore del bicchiere e versare lentamente la vodka.\r\nSe lo fai bene, dovresti essere in grado di vedere che i due liquidi sono separati, con la vodka sopra.\r\nOra sbattilo! L'ultima cosa che assaggerai è il kool-aid.", :strMeasure2 "1/2 oz ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-09-06 23:04:33", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Shot", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Vodka", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Shot glass", :strInstructionsDE "Füllen Sie zuerst die Hälfte des Schnapsglases mit dem Kool-Aid. Dann legen Sie ein Papiertuch über das Glas und gießen Sie den Wodka langsam ein. Wenn du es richtig machst, solltest du sehen können, dass die beiden Flüssigkeiten getrennt sind, mit dem Wodka oben drauf. Jetzt knall es rein! Das Letzte, was du schmecken wirst, ist das Kool-Aid.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 nil, :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Mettre le tout dans un mixeur et liquéfier.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Throw everything into a blender and liquify.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "3 ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Kiwi Papaya Smoothie", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/jogv4w1487603571.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 nil, :strInstructionsES "Echar todo en una batidora y licuar.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Kiwi", :idDrink "12714", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將所有東西放入攪拌機中並液化。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将所有东西放入搅拌机中并液化。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Getta tutto in un frullatore e liquida.", :strMeasure2 "1/2 ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-02-20 15:12:51", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Other / Unknown", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Papaya", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Highball Glass", :strInstructionsDE "Alles in einen Mixer geben und aufschlagen.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 nil, :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Non alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Faire un jus de gingembre et de citron et l'ajouter à de l'eau chaude. Vous pouvez ajouter de la cardamome.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Juice ginger and lemon and add it to hot water. You may add cardomom.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "1 inch ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Kill the cold Smoothie", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/7j1z2e1487603414.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1 cup hot ", :strInstructionsES "Haz zumo de jengibre y limón y añádelo al agua caliente. Puede añadir cardomomo.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Ginger", :idDrink "12720", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將生薑和檸檬榨汁，加入熱水中。您可以添加小荳蔻。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将生姜和柠檬榨汁，加入热水中。您可以添加小豆蔻。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Spremere lo zenzero e il limone e aggiungerlo all'acqua calda.Puoi aggiungere il cardamomo.", :strMeasure2 "1/4 ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-02-20 15:10:15", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Other / Unknown", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Lemon", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Highball glass", :strInstructionsDE "Ingwer und Zitrone entsaften und in heißes Wasser geben. Du kannst Cardomom hinzufügen.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Water", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Non alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil}]}, :fetched-at 1790009882369}, "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/api/json/v1/1/search.php?f=o" {:data {:drinks [{:strIngredient4 "Vodka", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Secouez tous les ingrédients avec de la glace, filtrez dans un verre à cocktail réfrigéré et servez.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Shake all ingredients with ice, strain into a chilled cocktail glass, and serve.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "1/2 oz white ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 "Light cream", :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Orgasm", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/vr6kle1504886114.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1/2 oz ", :strInstructionsES "Agite todos los ingredientes con hielo, cuele en una copa de cóctel fría y sirva.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Creme de Cacao", :idDrink "11872", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將所有材料加冰搖勻，濾入冰鎮的雞尾酒杯中即可享用。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将所有原料加冰摇匀​​，滤入冰镇的鸡尾酒杯中即可享用。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Shakerare tutti gli ingredienti con ghiaccio, filtrare in una coppetta da cocktail fredda e servire.", :strMeasure2 "1/2 oz ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-09-08 16:55:14", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Ordinary Drink", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Amaretto", :strMeasure4 "1/2 oz ", :strMeasure5 "1 oz ", :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Cocktail glass", :strInstructionsDE "Alle Zutaten mit Eis schütteln, in ein gekühltes Cocktailglas abseihen und servieren.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Triple sec", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Refroidissez le verre à cocktail. Ajouter les ingrédients dans un verre à mélange et remplir aux 2/3 de glace. Remuer environ 20 secondes. Videz le verre à cocktail et filtrez-le dans le verre. Garnir d'un zeste de citron.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Chill cocktail glass. Add ingredients to a mixing glass, and fill 2/3 full with ice. Stir about 20 seconds. Empty cocktail glass and strain into the glass. Garnish with a twist of lemon peel.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "2 oz", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Old Pal", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/x03td31521761009.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1 oz", :strInstructionsES "Copa de cóctel fría. Agregue los ingredientes a un vaso mezclador y llénelo 2/3 de su capacidad con hielo. Revuelva unos 20 segundos. Vaciar la copa de cóctel y colar en la copa. Adorne con una rodaja de piel de limón.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Rye whiskey", :idDrink "17827", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "冷卻雞尾酒杯。將食材加入攪拌杯中，並裝滿 2/3 的冰塊。攪拌約20秒。倒空雞尾酒杯並過濾到杯中。用檸檬皮裝飾。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "冷却鸡尾酒杯。将配料添加到搅拌杯中，并装满 2/3 的冰块。搅拌约20秒。倒空鸡尾酒杯并滤入杯中。用柠檬皮装饰。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Raffredda un bicchiere da cocktail.\r\nAggiungere gli ingredienti in un mixing glass e riempire con 2/3 di ghiaccio.\r\nMescola per circa 20 secondi.\r\nFiltrare nel bicchiere.\r\nGuarnire con una scorza di limone.", :strMeasure2 "1 oz", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2018-03-22 23:23:30", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Cocktail", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Campari", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Nick and Nora Glass", :strInstructionsDE "Cocktailglas kühl stellen. Geben Sie die Zutaten in ein Mischglas und füllen Sie 2/3 der Zutaten mit Eis. Etwa 20 Sekunden umrühren. Cocktailglas in das Glas abseihen. Mit einer Zitronenspirale garnieren.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Dry Vermouth", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "Angostura Bitters", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Secouez une poignée de menthe, 2 oz de rhum blanc, 1 oz de sirop de sucre, 1 oz de jus de citron vert et 2 traits d'angostura bitters avec de la glace. Passez le tout au chinois dans un verre et complétez avec 2 oz de prosecco.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Shake a handful of mint, 2oz white rum, 1oz of sugar syrup, 1oz lime juice and 2 dashes angostura bitters with ice. Double strain into a glass and top with 2oz of prosecco.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "2 oz", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 "Prosecco", :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Old Cuban", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/eo8gfx1699022995.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 "", :strMeasure3 "1 oz", :strInstructionsES "Agite con hielo un puñado de menta, 2 onzas de ron blanco, 1 onza de sirope de azúcar, 1 onza de zumo de lima y 2 chorritos de amargo de angostura. Cuele dos veces en un vaso y añada 2 onzas de prosecco.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "White Rum", :idDrink "178371", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將一把薄荷、2 盎司白蘭姆酒、1 盎司糖漿、1 盎司青檸汁和 2 滴安戈斯圖拉苦酒加冰搖勻。雙濾入玻璃杯中，並在上面加入 2 盎司普羅塞克。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将一把薄荷、2 盎司白朗姆酒、1 盎司糖浆、1 盎司青柠汁和 2 滴安戈斯图拉苦酒加冰摇匀。双滤入玻璃杯中，并在上面加入 2 盎司普罗塞克。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 "", :strInstructionsIT "Shakerare una manciata di menta, 2 once di rum bianco, 1 oncia di sciroppo di zucchero, 1 oncia di succo di lime e 2 gocce di angostura bitter con ghiaccio. Filtrare due volte in un bicchiere e completare con 2 once di prosecco.", :strMeasure2 "1 oz", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified nil, :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Cocktail", :strMeasure6 "", :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Sugar Syrup", :strMeasure4 "2 dashes", :strMeasure5 "2 oz", :strIngredient6 "", :strImageSource "Instagram", :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Cocktail glass", :strInstructionsDE "Schütteln Sie eine Handvoll Minze, 2 Unzen weißen Rum, 1 Unze Zuckersirup, 1 Unze Limettensaft und 2 Spritzer Angosturabitter mit Eis. Doppelt in ein Glas abseihen und mit 2 Unzen Prosecco auffüllen.\n", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Lime Juice", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "Soda water", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Placez des glaçons dans un grand verre à pied ou à cocktail, ajoutez le jus de citron, le jus d'orange, le sirop de sucre et remuez bien. Compléter avec de l'eau gazeuse froide et servir avec une paille.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Place some ice cubes in a large tumbler or highball glass, add lemon juice, orange juice, sugar syrup, and stir well. Top up with cold soda water, serve with a drinking straw.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "5 cl ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Orangeade", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/ytsxxw1441167732.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "2-3 cl ", :strInstructionsES "Ponga unos cubitos de hielo en un vaso grande, añada zumo de limón, zumo de naranja, jarabe de azúcar y remueva bien. Añada agua con gas fría y sírvalo con una pajita.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Lemon juice", :idDrink "12618", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將一些冰塊放入大玻璃杯或高球杯中，加入檸檬汁、柳橙汁、糖漿，攪拌均勻。加滿冷蘇打水，用吸管飲用。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将一些冰块放入大玻璃杯或高球杯中，加入柠檬汁、橙汁、糖浆，搅拌均匀。加满冷苏打水，用吸管饮用。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Mettere alcuni cubetti di ghiaccio in un grande bicchiere tumbler o highball, aggiungere il succo di limone, il succo d'arancia, lo sciroppo di zucchero e mescolare bene.Rabboccare con acqua fredda di soda, servire con una cannuccia.", :strMeasure2 "15 cl ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2015-09-02 05:22:12", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Cocktail", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Orange juice", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Highball glass", :strInstructionsDE "Legen Sie einige Eiswürfel in einen großen Becher oder ein Highball-Glas, geben Sie Zitronensaft, Orangensaft, Zuckersirup hinzu und rühren Sie gut um. Mit kaltem Sodawasser auffüllen, mit einem Trinkhalm servieren.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Sugar syrup", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Non alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "Cream", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Verser les ingrédients sur de la glace et remuer.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Pour ingredients over ice and stir.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "4 oz ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 "Ice", :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Orange Whip", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/ttyrxr1454514759.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :