nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "4 oz", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 "Lime", :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Pineapple Paloma", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/pg8iw31593351601.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1 oz", :strInstructionsES "Frote el borde de cada vaso con una rodaja de lima y sumérjalo en sal.\r\nAñade hielo, tequila, zumo de pomelo, zumo de lima y completa con soda de piña.\r\nRemover rápidamente.\r\nDecorar con piña fresca o lima.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Tequila", :idDrink "178327", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "用石灰片擦拭每個玻璃杯的邊緣，然後浸入鹽中。\r\n加入冰塊、龍舌蘭、葡萄柚汁、萊姆汁，最後加入鳳梨蘇打水。\r\n快速攪拌一下。\r\n用新鮮鳳梨或酸橙裝飾。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "用石灰片擦拭每个玻璃杯的边缘，然后浸入盐中。\r\n添加冰块、龙舌兰酒、葡萄柚汁、酸橙汁，最后加入菠萝苏打水。\r\n快速搅拌一下。\r\n用新鲜菠萝或酸橙装饰。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 "", :strInstructionsIT "Strofina il bordo di ogni bicchiere con uno spicchio di lime e salalo.\r\nAggiungi ghiaccio, tequila, succo di pompelmo, succo di lime e aggiungi la soda all'ananas.\r\nDagli una rapida mescolata.\r\nGuarnire con ananas fresco o lime.", :strMeasure2 "4 oz", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified nil, :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Cocktail", :strMeasure6 "Rimmed", :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Grapefruit Juice", :strMeasure4 "8 oz", :strMeasure5 "Garnish with", :strIngredient6 "Pepper", :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Collins glass", :strInstructionsDE nil, :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Fresh Lime Juice", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "Yes", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "Lime", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Droit : Versez tous les ingrédients dans un verre à mélange avec des glaçons. Bien agiter. Filtrer dans un verre à cocktail à martini réfrigéré. Coupez le fruit de la passion en deux et utilisez-le comme garniture. Versez le prosecco dans un verre à shot réfrigéré et servez avec le martini.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Straight: Pour all ingredients into mixing glass with ice cubes. Shake well. Strain in chilled martini cocktail glass. Cut passion fruit in half and use as garnish. Pour prosecco into a chilled shot glass and serve alongside the martini.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags "Adult, Shot, Bubbly", :strMeasure1 "3 cl", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 "Prosecco", :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Pornstar Martini", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/xjhjdf1630406071.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1 cl", :strInstructionsES "Directo: Vierta todos los ingredientes en un vaso mezclador con cubitos de hielo. Agite bien. Colar en una copa de cóctel de martini fría. Corta la maracuyá por la mitad y úsala como guarnición. Vierta el prosecco en un vaso de chupito frío y sírvalo junto con el martini.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Vodka", :idDrink "178357", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "直接：將所有原料倒入裝有冰塊的混合杯中。搖勻。濾入冰鎮馬丁尼雞尾酒杯。將百香果切成兩半並用作裝飾。將普羅塞克倒入冰鎮的玻璃杯中，與馬丁尼一起享用。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "直接：将所有原料倒入装有冰块的混合杯中。摇匀。滤入冰镇马提尼鸡尾酒杯。将百香果切成两半并用作装饰。将普罗塞克倒入冰镇的玻璃杯中，与马提尼一起享用。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 "", :strInstructionsIT "Dritto: versare tutti gli ingredienti nel mixing glass con cubetti di ghiaccio. Agitare bene. Filtrare nella coppetta da cocktail Martini ghiacciata. Tagliate il frutto della passione a metà e usatelo come guarnizione. Versare il prosecco in un bicchierino ghiacciato e servire insieme al martini.\n", :strMeasure2 "3 cl", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified nil, :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Cocktail", :strMeasure6 "", :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Passoa", :strMeasure4 "1 cl", :strMeasure5 "1 shot", :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource "https://www.instagram.com/p/CTMhXyaIvIT", :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Cocktail glass", :strInstructionsDE "Pur: Alle Zutaten mit Eiswürfeln in ein Rührglas geben. Gut schütteln. In ein gekühltes Martini-Cocktailglas abseihen. Passionsfrucht halbieren und als Garnitur verwenden. Prosecco in ein gekühltes Schnapsglas füllen und zusammen mit dem Martini servieren.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Passion fruit juice", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "Grenadine", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Presser une orange et filtrer le jus. Mettez tous les ingrédients dans un shaker rempli de glace et secouez pendant au moins 12 secondes. Filtrez dans un verre highball et décorez avec un quartier d'ananas ou un fruit de votre choix.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Squeeze an orange and strain the juice. Put all the ingredients in a shaker filled with ice and shake for at least 12 seconds. Strain into a highball glass and decorate with a pineapple wedge or fruit of your choice.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "4.5 cL", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 "Sugar Syrup", :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Planter’s Punch", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/jn6o251643844541.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "3.5 cl", :strInstructionsES "Exprimir una naranja y colar el zumo. Poner todos los ingredientes en una coctelera con hielo y agitar durante al menos 12 segundos. Cuélalo en un vaso highball y decóralo con un trozo de piña o la fruta que prefieras.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Dark Rum", :idDrink "178368", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "擠壓柳橙並濾出汁液。將所有原料放入裝滿冰塊的搖酒壺中，搖晃至少 12 秒。過濾到高球杯中，用鳳梨塊或您選擇的水果裝飾。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "挤压橙子并滤出汁液。将所有原料放入装满冰块的摇酒壶中，摇晃至少 12 秒。滤入高球杯中，用菠萝块或您选择的水果装饰。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 "", :strInstructionsIT "Spremete un’arancia e filtratene il succo. Mettete tutti gli ingredienti in uno shaker colmo di ghiaccio e agitate per almeno 12 secondi. Versate filtrando in un bicchiere highball e decorate con uno spicchio d’ananas o frutta a piacere.", :strMeasure2 "3 cl", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified nil, :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Cocktail", :strMeasure6 "4 drops", :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Orange Juice", :strMeasure4 "1 cl", :strMeasure5 "1 cl", :strIngredient6 "Angostura Bitters", :strImageSource "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/10/Planters_Punch_2.jpg", :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Highball glass", :strInstructionsDE "Eine Orange auspressen und den Saft abseihen. Alle Zutaten in einen mit Eis gefüllten Shaker geben und mindestens 12 Sekunden schütteln. In ein Longdrinkglas abseihen und mit einer Ananasscheibe oder Früchten Ihrer Wahl dekorieren.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Pineapple Juice", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Versez délicatement dans un verre pousse-café, afin que la crème de menthe flotte sur la grenadine. Servir sans mélanger.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Pour carefully into a pousse-cafe glass, so that creme de menthe floats on grenadine. Serve without mixing.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "1 tblsp ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Port And Starboard", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/wxvupx1441553911.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 nil, :strInstructionsES "Vierta con cuidado en un vaso de pousse-café, de modo que la crema de menta flote sobre la granadina. Servir sin mezclar.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Grenadine", :idDrink "11961", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "小心倒入咖啡杯中，使薄荷糖浮在石榴糖漿上。無需混合即可食用。", :