ots ", :strInstructionsES "Empieza con el Sprite. A continuación, el tequila. A continuación, añada Minute Maid Fruit Punch y deje flotar la 151. Rocas opcionales.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Fruit punch", :idDrink "16991", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "從精靈開始。接下來是龍舌蘭。之後，加入美汁源水果潘趣酒，然後加入 151. Rocks（可選）。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "从精灵开始。接下来是龙舌兰酒。之后，加入美汁源水果潘趣酒，然后加入 151. Rocks（可选）。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Inizia con la Sprite.\r\nPoi versa la tequila.\r\nDopodiché, aggiungi il Minute Maid Fruit Punch, infine versare il 151.\r\nGhiaccio opzionale.", :strMeasure2 "1 part ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-08-24 09:38:31", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Punch / Party Drink", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Sprite", :strMeasure4 "Float Bacardi ", :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Hurricane glass", :strInstructionsDE "Beginne mit dem Sprite. Als nächstes kommt der Tequila. Danach geben Sie die Minute Maid Fruit Punch hinzu, dann schwenken Sie die 151. Rocks optional.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Tequila", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Dans un verre highball presque rempli de glaçons, mélanger le gin et le ginger ale. Bien mélanger. Garnir avec le quartier de citron vert.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "In a highball glass almost filled with ice cubes, combine the gin and ginger ale. Stir well. Garnish with the lime wedge.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "1 1/2 oz ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Dragonfly", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/uc63bh1582483589.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1 ", :strInstructionsES "En un vaso highball casi lleno de cubitos de hielo, mezcle la ginebra y el ginger ale. Remover bien. Decorar con la rodaja de lima.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Gin", :idDrink "11320", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "在幾乎裝滿冰塊的高球杯中，將琴酒和薑汁汽水混合。攪拌均勻。用青檸角裝飾。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "在几乎装满冰块的高球杯中，将杜松子酒和姜汁汽水混合。搅拌均匀。用青柠角装饰。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "In un bicchiere highball quasi riempito con cubetti di ghiaccio, unire il gin e la ginger ale. Mescolare bene. Guarnire con lo spicchio di lime.", :strMeasure2 "4 oz ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-09-02 22:51:40", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Ordinary Drink", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Ginger ale", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Highball glass", :strInstructionsDE "In einem Highball-Glas, das fast mit Eiswürfeln gefüllt ist, den Gin mit dem Ginger Ale vermengen. Gut umrühren. Mit dem Limettenkeil garnieren.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Lime", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "Yes", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Droit : Verser tous les ingrédients dans un verre à mélange avec des glaçons. Bien mélanger. Filtrer dans un verre à cocktail martini réfrigéré. Presser l'huile du zeste de citron sur la boisson ou décorer d'une olive.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Straight: Pour all ingredients into mixing glass with ice cubes. Stir well. Strain in chilled martini cocktail glass. Squeeze oil from lemon peel onto the drink, or garnish with olive.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags "IBA,Classic,Christmas,Alcoholic", :strMeasure1 "1 2/3 oz ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution "TheCocktailDB.com", :strDrink "Dry Martini", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/6ck9yi1589574317.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1 ", :strInstructionsES "Derecho: Vierta todos los ingredientes en un vaso mezclador con cubitos de hielo. Remover bien. Colar en una copa de martini fría. Exprima el aceite de la cáscara de limón sobre la bebida, o decore con aceitunas.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA "Unforgettables", :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Gin", :idDrink "11005", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "直接：將所有原料倒入裝有冰塊的混合杯中。攪拌均勻。濾入冰鎮馬丁尼雞尾酒杯。將檸檬皮中的油擠到飲料上，或用橄欖裝飾。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "直接：将所有原料倒入装有冰块的混合杯中。搅拌均匀。滤入冰镇马提尼鸡尾酒杯。将柠檬皮中的油挤到饮料上，或用橄榄装饰。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Dritto: Versare tutti gli ingredienti nel mixing glass con cubetti di ghiaccio. Mescolare bene. Filtrare in una coppetta da cocktail Martini ghiacciata. Spremi l'olio della scorza di limone sulla bevanda o guarnisci con l'oliva.", :strMeasure2 "1/3 oz ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-09-02 12:51:35", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Cocktail", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Dry Vermouth", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/drink/11005", :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Cocktail glass", :strInstructionsDE "Pur: Alle Zutaten mit Eiswürfeln in ein Rührglas geben. Gut umrühren. In ein gekühltes Martini-Cocktailglas abseihen. Drücken Sie das Öl aus der Zitronenschale auf das Getränk oder garnieren Sie es mit Oliven.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Olive", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "Yes", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Dans un verre à mélange à moitié rempli de glaçons, mélanger le scotch et le vermouth. Bien mélanger. Filtrer dans un verre à cocktail. Décorer avec le zeste de citron.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "In a mixing glass half-filled with ice cubes, combine the Scotch and vermouth. Stir well. Strain into a cocktail glass. Garnish with the lemon twist.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "2 1/2 oz ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Dry Rob Roy", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/typuyq1439456976.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1 twist of ", :strInstructionsES "En un vaso mezclador lleno hasta la mitad con cubitos de hielo, mezcle el whisky y el vermut. Remover bien. Colar en una copa de cóctel. Decorar con el twist de limón.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Scotch", :idDrink "11324", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "在裝有半杯冰塊的攪拌杯中，將蘇格蘭威士忌和苦艾酒混合。攪拌均勻。濾入雞尾酒杯。用檸檬片裝飾。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "在装有半杯冰块的搅拌杯中，将苏格兰威士忌和苦艾酒混合。搅拌均匀。滤入鸡尾酒杯。用柠檬片装饰。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "In un mixing glass riempito a metà con cubetti di ghiaccio, unire lo scotch e il vermouth.Filtrare in un bicchiere da cocktail. Mescolare bene. Guarnire con la scorza di limone", :strMeasure2 "1 1/2 tsp ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified nil, :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Ordinary Drink", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Dry Vermouth", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Cocktail glass", :strInstructionsDE "In einem Mischglas, das halb mit Eiswürfeln gefüllt ist, den Scotch mit Wermut kombinieren. Gut umrühren. In ein Cocktailglas abseihen. Mit der Zitronenscheibe garnieren.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Lemon peel", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Il s'agit d'une photo superposée : les Bailey doivent être au top.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "This is a layered shot - the Bailey's must be on top", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 nil, :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Dirty Nipple", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/vtyqrt1461866508.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 nil, :strInstructionsES "Esta es una toma en capas: Bailey's debe estar en la cima.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Kahlua", :idDrink "14466", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "這是一個分層的鏡頭 - 貝利酒必須在上面", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "这是一个分层的镜头 - 贝利酒必须在上面", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Questo è uno shot a strati, il Bailey deve essere versato per ultimo.", :strMeasure2 nil, :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2016-04-28 19:01:49", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Shot", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Sambuca", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Shot glass", :strInstructionsDE "Dies ist ein mehrschichtiger Schnaps - der Bailey's muss oben sein.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Baileys irish cream", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "Lemon", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Verser la vodka, le vermouth sec et la saumure d'olive dans un shaker avec une poignée de glace et bien secouer.\r\nFrotter le bord d'un verre à martini avec le quartier de citron.\r\nFiltrer le contenu du shaker dans le verre et ajouter l'olive.\r\nUn dirty Martini contient un peu de saumure d'olive ou de jus d'olive et est généralement décoré d'une olive.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Pour the vodka, dry vermouth and olive brine into a cocktail shaker with a handful of ice and shake well.\r\nRub the rim of a martini glass with the wedge of lemon.\r\nStrain the contents of the cocktail shaker into the glass and add the olive.\r\nA dirty Martini contains a splash of olive brine or olive juice and is typically garnished with an olive.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags "IBA,NewEra", :strMeasure1 "70ml/2fl oz", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 "Olive", :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Dirty Martini", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/vcyvpq1485083300.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "2 tbsp", :strInstructionsES "Vierta el vodka, el vermut seco y la salmuera de aceitunas en una coctelera con un puñado de hielo y agite bien.\r\nFrotar el borde de una copa de martini con la rodaja de limón.\r\nCuele el contenido de la coctelera en la copa y añada la aceituna.\r\nUn martini sucio contiene un chorrito de salmuera de aceituna o zumo de aceituna y suele adornarse con una aceituna.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA "New Era Drinks", :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Vodka", :idDrink "17181", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將伏特加、乾苦艾酒和橄欖鹽水倒入雞尾酒調酒器中，加入少量冰塊，搖勻。\r\n用檸檬角擦拭馬丁尼酒杯的邊緣。\r\n將雞尾酒調酒器中的內容物過濾到玻璃杯中，然後加入橄欖。\r\n骯髒的馬丁尼含有少量的橄欖鹽水或橄欖汁，通常用橄欖裝飾。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将伏特加、干苦艾酒和橄榄盐水倒入鸡尾酒调酒器中，加入少量冰块，摇匀。\r\n用柠檬角擦拭马提尼酒杯的边缘。\r\n将鸡尾酒调酒器中的内容物滤入玻璃杯中，然后添加橄榄。\r\n肮脏的马提尼酒含有少量的橄榄盐水或橄榄汁，通常用橄榄装饰。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Versare la vodka, il vermouth secco e la salamoia in uno shaker con una manciata di ghiaccio e agitare bene.\r\nStrofina il bordo di un bicchiere da martini con la fetta di limone.\r\nFiltrare il contenuto dello shaker nel bicchiere e aggiungere l'oliva.\r\nUn Martini sporco contiene una spruzzata di salamoia o succo di oliva ed è tipicamente guarnito con un'oliva.", :strMeasure2 "1 tbsp", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-01-22 11:08:20", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Cocktail", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Dry Vermouth", :strMeasure4 "1 wedge", :strMeasure5 "1", :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Cocktail glass", :strInstructionsDE "Wodka, trockenen Wermut und Olivensole in einen Cocktailshaker mit einer Handvoll Eis geben und gut schütteln.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Olive Brine", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "Ice", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Il existe de nombreuses liqueurs de cerises, mais je préfère la liqueur Heering. Ajoutez une part de la liqueur. Ajoutez ensuite une part de soda. Pour un sling acide, utilisez du Tonic (la plupart des gens préfèrent la boisson sans Tonic). Remplissez ensuite le verre avec du jus d'orange et des glaçons.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "There are many good cherry liqueurs you can use, but I prefere Heering. Add one share of the liqueur. Then you add one share of Soda. For a sour sling use Tonic (most people prefer the drink without Tonic). Afterwards you fill the glass with Orange Juice and ice cubes.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "1 part ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Darkwood Sling", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/sxxsyq1472719303.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1 part ", :strInstructionsES "Se pueden utilizar muchos licores de cereza buenos, pero yo prefiero el Heering. Añada una parte del licor. A continuación, añada una parte de soda. Para un sour sling utiliza Tónica (la mayoría de la gente prefiere la bebida sin Tónica). Después se llena el vaso con zumo de naranja y cubitos de hielo.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Cherry Heering", :idDrink "14482", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "有許多優質的櫻桃利口酒可供選擇，但我更喜歡 Heering。加入一份利口酒。然後加入一份蘇打水。對於酸吊帶，請使用滋補品（大多數人喜歡不添加滋補品的飲料）。然後在玻璃杯中倒入柳橙汁和冰塊。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "有很多优质的樱桃利口酒可供选择，但我更喜欢 Heering。添加一份利口酒。然后添加一份苏打水。对于酸吊带，请使用滋补品（大多数人更喜欢不添加滋补品的饮料）。然后在玻璃杯中倒入橙汁和冰块。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Ci sono molti buoni liquori alla ciliegia che puoi usare, ma preferisco Heering.\r\nAggiungi una parte del liquore.\r\nQuindi aggiungi una parte di acqua di seltz.\r\nPer un drink più acido ( sour )  usa il tonico (la maggior parte delle persone preferisce la bevanda senza tonico).\r\nSuccessivamente si riempie il bicchiere con succo d'arancia e cubetti di ghiaccio.", :strMeasure2 "1 part ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2016-09-01 09:41:43", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Soft Drink", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Soda water", :strMeasure4 "cubes", :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Cocktail glass", :strInstructionsDE "Es gibt viele gute Kirschliköre, die Sie verwenden können, aber ich bevorzuge Heering. Eine Portion des Likörs nehmen. Dann fügen Sie eine Portion Soda hinzu. Für eine saure Note verwenden Sie Tonic (die meisten Menschen bevorzugen das Getränk ohne Tonic). Danach füllen Sie das Glas mit Orangensaft und Eiswürfeln.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Orange juice", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Dans un verre highball rempli de glace, ajouter 6 cl de rhum noir et compléter avec de la bière de gingembre. Garnir avec un quartier de citron vert.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "In a highball glass filled with ice add 6cl dark rum and top with ginger beer. Garnish with lime wedge.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags "IBA,NewEra", :strMeasure1 "5 cl", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Dark and Stormy", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/t1tn0s1504374905.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 nil, :strInstructionsES "En un vaso highball lleno de hielo, añadir 6 cl de ron oscuro y completar con cerveza de jengibre. Decorar con una rodaja de lima.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA "New Era Drinks", :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Dark Rum", :idDrink "17211", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "在裝滿冰塊的高球杯中加入 6 厘升黑蘭姆酒，並在上面倒入薑汁啤酒。用酸橙角裝飾。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "在装满冰块的高球杯中加入 6 厘升黑朗姆酒，并在上面倒入姜汁啤酒。用酸橙角装饰。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "In un bicchiere highball pieno di ghiaccio aggiungere 6 cl di rum scuro e guarnire con ginger beer.\r\nGuarnire con uno spicchio di lime.", :strMeasure2 "10 cl", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-09-02 18:55:05", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Ordinary Drink", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Ginger Beer", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Highball glass", :strInstructionsDE "In einem mit Eis gefüllten Highball-Glas 6 cl dunklen Rum hinzufügen und mit Ingwerbier auffüllen. Mit Limettenkeil garnieren.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 nil, :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Mélanger le sucre avec les quartiers de citron vert dans un verre à l'ancienne.\r\nRemplir le verre de glaçons.\r\nVerser la cachaca dans le verre.\r\nBien mélanger.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Muddle the sugar into the lime wedges in an old-fashioned glass.\r\nFill the glass with ice cubes.\r\nPour the cachaca into the glass.\r\nStir well.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "2 tsp ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Dark Caipirinha", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/uwstrx1472406058.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "2 1/2 oz", :strInstructionsES "Mezcle el azúcar con los gajos de lima en un vaso old-fashioned.\r\nLlene el vaso con cubitos de hielo.\r\nVierta la cachaca en el vaso.\r\nRemuévalo bien.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "demerara Sugar", :idDrink "17177", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將糖混入老式玻璃杯中的酸橙塊中。\r\n將玻璃杯裝滿冰塊。\r\n將卡查卡倒入玻璃杯中。\r\n攪拌均勻。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将糖混入老式玻璃杯中的酸橙块中。\r\n将玻璃杯装满冰块。\r\n将卡查卡倒入玻璃杯中。\r\n搅拌均匀。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Pestare lo zucchero con gli spicchi di lime in un bicchiere vecchio stile, riempire il bicchiere con cubetti di ghiaccio, versare la cachaca nel bicchiere e mescolare bene.", :strMeasure2 "1", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2016-08-28 18:40:58", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Cocktail", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Lime", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Highball glass", :strInstructionsDE "Den Zucker in einem old-fashioned Glas in die Limettenspalten mischen.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Cachaca", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "Yes", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "St. Germain", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Agiter tous les ingrédients.\r\nPasser au chinois dans un verre double old fashioned bien frais avec un gros glaçon.\r\nDécorer avec quelques brins de lavande.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Shake all ingredients.\r\nDouble strain in a chilled double old fashioned glass with abig ice cube.\r\nGarnish with a couple of lavender sprigs", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "5 cl", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 "Angostura Bitters", :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Duchamp's Punch", :strDrinkThumb "https:/