en (außer Ginger Ale) mit Eis schütteln und in ein Collins-Glas über Eiswürfel abseihen. Mit Ginger Ale füllen, umrühren und servieren.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Grenadine", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "Lemon", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Secouez la tequila, le jus de citron et le sucre en poudre avec de la glace et filtrez dans un verre à whisky aigre. Ajouter la demi-tranche de citron, garnir de cerise et servir.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Shake tequila, juice of lemon, and powdered sugar with ice and strain into a whiskey sour glass. Add the half-slice of lemon, top with the cherry, and serve.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "2 oz ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 "Cherry", :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Tequila Sour", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/ek0mlq1504820601.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1 tsp ", :strInstructionsES "Agite el tequila, el jugo de limón y el azúcar en polvo con hielo y cuele en un vaso de whisky sour. Agrega la media rodaja de limón, cubre con la cereza y sirve.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Tequila", :idDrink "12370", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將龍舌蘭、檸檬汁和糖粉加冰搖勻，濾入威士忌酸酒杯中。加入半片檸檬，上面放上櫻桃，即可食用。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将龙舌兰酒、柠檬汁和糖粉加冰摇匀，滤入威士忌酸酒杯中。加入半片柠檬，上面放上樱桃，即可食用。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Shakerare la tequila, il succo di limone e lo zucchero a velo con ghiaccio e filtrare in un bicchiere da whisky sour.Aggiungere la mezza fetta di limone, guarnire con la ciliegia e servire.", :strMeasure2 "Juice of 1/2 ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-09-07 22:43:21", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Ordinary Drink", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Lemon", :strMeasure4 "1/