mind. 50 cl) mischen. Füllen Sie den Rest des Glases mit Kaffee.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Coffee", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Secouer les ingrédients avec de la glace pilée\r\n", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Shake ingredients with crushed ice\r\n", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags "Sweet", :strMeasure1 "6 cl", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Honey Bee", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/vu8l7t1582475673.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "2 cl", :strInstructionsES "Agitar los ingredientes con hielo picado\r\n", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "White Rum", :idDrink "178316", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將食材與碎冰一起搖勻", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将配料与碎冰一起摇匀", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 "", :strInstructionsIT "Shakerare gli ingredienti con ghiaccio tritato", :strMeasure2 "2 cl", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified nil, :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Cocktail", :strMeasure6 "", :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Honey", :strMeasure4 "", :strMeasure5 "", :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Margarita glass", :strInstructionsDE nil, :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Lemon Juice", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "Yes", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "lemon", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "ÉTAPE 1\r\nFouettez le whisky et le miel ensemble et répartissez-les dans deux verres résistants à la chaleur. Ajoutez la moitié du bâton de cannelle dans chaque verre, puis complétez avec 200 ml d'eau bouillante.\r\n\r\nÉTAPE 2\r\nAjoutez un filet de jus de citron dans chaque verre, puis goûtez et ajoutez-en selon vos préférences. Terminez chaque verre par une tranche de citron piquée d'un clou de girofle et servez immédiatement.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "STEP 1\r\nWhisk the whisky and honey together and split between 2 heatproof glasses. Add half of the cinnamon stick to each, then top up with 200ml boiling water.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\nAdd a splash of lemon juice to each, then taste and add more to your preference. Finish each with a slice of lemon, studded with a clove, and serve immediately.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags "Winter", :strMeasure1 "50 ml", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 "Cloves", :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Hot Toddy", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/ggx0lv1613942306.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1", :strInstructionsES "PASO 1\r\nBata el whisky y la miel y repártalos en 2 vasos refractarios. Añada la mitad de la rama de canela a cada uno y, a continuación, añada 200 ml de agua hirviendo.\r\n\r\nPASO 2\r\nAñada un chorrito de zumo de limón a cada vaso, pruébelo y añada el zumo que prefiera. Termine cada uno con una rodaja de limón, salpicada con un clavo, y sirva inmediatamente.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Whiskey", :idDrink "178345", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "步驟1\r\n將威士忌和蜂蜜攪拌在一起，然後分裝在兩個耐熱玻璃杯中。每份加入一半肉桂棒，然後加入 200 毫升沸水。\r\n\r\n步驟2\r\n每份都加入一點檸檬汁，然後品嚐並根據您的喜好添加更多。最後放上一片檸檬，並鑲上丁香，然後立即食用。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "步骤1\r\n将威士忌和蜂蜜搅拌在一起，然后分装在两个耐热玻璃杯中。每份加入一半肉桂棒，然后加入 200 毫升沸水。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n每份都加入一点柠檬汁，然后品尝并根据您的喜好添加更多。最后放上一片柠檬，并镶上丁香，然后立即食用。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 "", :strInstructionsIT "PASSO 1\r\nSbatti il whisky e il miele insieme e dividi in 2 bicchieri. Aggiungere metà della stecca di cannella a ciascuna, quindi rabboccare con 200 ml di acqua bollente.\r\n\r\nPASSO 2\r\nAggiungi una spruzzata di succo di limone a ciascuno, quindi assaggia e aggiungi altro a tua preferenza. Terminate ciascuna con una fetta di limone, guarnire con uno spicchio, e servite subito.", :strMeasure2 "15 ml", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified nil, :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Cocktail", :strMeasure6 "", :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Honey", :strMeasure4 "1", :strMeasure5 "2", :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource "https://www.flickr.com/photos/patruby/7343589018", :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Irish coffee cup", :strInstructionsDE nil, :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Cinnamon", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Versez Hot Damn 100 au fond d’un pot ou d’un verre ordinaire. Remplissez le reste du verre de thé sucré. Remuer avec une cuillère, une paille ou, mieux encore, un bâton de cannelle et laisser agir.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Pour Hot Damn 100 in bottom of a jar or regular glass. Fill the rest of the glass with sweet tea. Stir with spoon, straw, or better yet a cinnamon stick and leave it in.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "5 shots ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Herbal flame", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/rrstxv1441246184.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 nil, :strInstructionsES "Vierta Hot Damn 100 en el fondo de un frasco o vaso normal. Llena el resto del vaso con té dulce. Revuelva con una cuchara, una pajita o, mejor aún, una rama de canela y déjela reposar.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Hot Damn", :idDrink "15813", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將 Hot Damn 100 倒入罐子或普通玻璃杯的底部。將剩下的杯子裝滿甜茶。用湯匙、吸管或更好的是肉桂棒攪拌，然後將其留在裡面。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将 Hot Damn 100 倒入罐子或普通玻璃杯的底部。将剩下的杯子装满甜茶。用勺子、吸管或者更好的是肉桂棒搅拌，然后将其留在里面。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Versa Hot Damn 100 sul fondo di un barattolo o di un bicchiere normale.\r\nRiempi il resto del bicchiere con tè dolce.\r\nMescola con un cucchiaio, una cannuccia o, meglio ancora, una stecca di cannella e lasciala dentro.", :strMeasure2 "very sweet ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2015-09-03 03:09:44", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Coffee / Tea", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Tea", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Mason jar", :strInstructionsDE "Gießen Sie Hot Damn 100 auf den Boden eines normalen Glases. Füllen Sie den Rest des Glases mit süßem Tee. Mit einem Löffel, Strohhalm oder besser noch einer Zimtstange umrühren und darin belassen.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 nil, :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "Bitters", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Verser le brandy et le soda au gingembre directement dans un verre highball avec des glaçons. Remuer doucement. Garnir de zestes de citron. Si vous le souhaitez, ajoutez des traits d'Angostura Bitter.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Pour brandy and ginger ale directly into highball glass with ice cubes. Stir gently. Garnish with lemon zest. If desired, add dashes of Angostura Bitter.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags "IBA,ContemporaryClassic", :strMeasure1 "1 long strip ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Horse's Neck", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/006k4e1504370092.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "5 oz ", :strInstructionsES "Vierta el brandy y el ginger ale directamente en un vaso highball con cubitos de hielo. Remover suavemente. Decorar con ralladura de limón. Si lo desea, añada unos chorritos de amargo de angostura.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA "Contemporary Classics", :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Lemon peel", :idDrink "17202", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將白蘭地和薑汁汽水直接倒入裝有冰塊的高球杯中。輕輕攪拌。用檸檬皮裝飾。如有需要，可添加少許安古斯圖拉苦酒。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将白兰地和姜汁汽水直接倒入装有冰块的高球杯中。轻轻搅拌。用柠檬皮装饰。如果需要，可添加少许安古斯图拉苦酒。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Versare brandy e ginger ale direttamente in un bicchiere highball con cubetti di ghiaccio.\r\nMescola delicatamente.\r\nGuarnire con la scorza di limone.\r\nSe lo desideri, aggiungi un pizzico di Angostura Bitter.", :strMeasure2 "2 oz ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-09-02 17:34:52", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Ordinary Drink", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Brandy", :strMeasure4 "2 dashes ", :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Highball glass", :strInstructionsDE "Gießen Sie Brandy und Ginger Ale direkt in das Highball-Glas mit Eiswürfeln. Vorsichtig umrühren. Mit Zitronenschale garnieren. Auf Wunsch können Sie auch Spritzer von Angostura Bitter hinzufügen.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Ginger ale", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "Ice", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Verser le rhum épicé Captain Morgan sur des glaçons, remplir le verre jusqu'en haut avec du Ginger Ale. Garnir de citron vert. Le goût est celui d'un soda à la crème. Nommée en référence à l'île de Gilligan (\"Le capitaine\" *dans* \"Ginger\" est un Skipper heureux !).", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Pour Captain Morgan's Spiced Rum over ice, fill glass to top with Ginger Ale. Garnish with lime. Tastes like a cream soda. Named for the Gilligan's Island reference (\"The Captain\" *in* \"Ginger\" is a Happy Skipper!)", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "1 1/2 cl ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Happy Skipper", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/42w2g41487602448.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 nil, :strInstructionsES "Vierta el ron Captain Morgan's Spiced sobre hielo, llene el vaso hasta arriba con Ginger Ale. Adorne con lima. Sabe como un refresco de crema. Llamado así por la referencia a Gilligan's Island (\"The Captain\" *in* \"Ginger\" is a Happy Skipper!)", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Spiced rum", :idDrink "12766", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將摩根船長的香料蘭姆酒倒入冰塊中，倒入玻璃杯，倒入薑汁汽水。用石灰裝飾。嘗起來像奶油蘇打水。以吉利根島命名（《金傑》中的「船長」是一位快樂的船長！）", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将摩根船长的香料朗姆酒倒入冰块中，倒入玻璃杯，倒入姜汁汽水。用石灰装饰。尝起来像奶油苏打水。以吉利根岛命名（《金杰》中的“船长”是一位快乐的船长！）", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Versare il rum speziato di Captain Morgan sul ghiaccio, riempire il bicchiere con Ginger Ale. Guarnire con il lime. Chiamato per il riferimento a Gilligan's Island (\"Il capitano\" * in * \"Ginger\" è uno skipper felice!)", :strMeasure2 nil, :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-02-20 14:54:09", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Ordinary Drink", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Ginger ale", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Highball glass", :strInstructionsDE "Captain Morgan's Spiced Rum über Eis in ein mit Eis gefüllten Glas giessen und mit Ginger Ale auffüllen. Mit Limette garnieren. Schmeckt wie ein Sahnesoda. Benannt nach der Referenz auf die Gilligan's Island (\"The Captain\" *in* \"Ginger\" ist ein glücklicher Skipper!)", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Lime", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "Lemonade", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Mettez le Bombay Sapphire, le Martini Bianco, le sirop de sucre et les mûres dans un shaker avec beaucoup de glace et secouez vigoureusement avant de verser dans un verre ballon, de compléter avec de la limonade et de décorer avec un quartier d'orange.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Put the Bombay Sapphire, Martini Bianco, sugar syrup & blackberries in a cocktail shaker with lots of ice and shake vigorously before pouring into a balloon glass, topping up with lemonade and garnishing with a wedge of orange.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "25 ml", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 "Blackberries", :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Hunter's Moon", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/t0iugg1509556712.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "10 ml", :strInstructionsES "Ponga el Bombay Sapphire, el Martini Bianco, el sirope de azúcar y las moras en una coctelera con mucho hielo y agite enérgicamente antes de verter en una copa globo, completar con limonada y decorar con un gajo de naranja.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Vermouth", :idDrink "17239", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將孟買藍寶石、白馬丁尼、糖漿和黑莓放入裝有大量冰塊的雞尾酒調酒器中，劇烈搖晃，然後倒入氣球玻璃杯中，加入檸檬水，並用一塊橙子裝飾。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将孟买蓝宝石、白马提尼、糖浆和黑莓放入装有大量冰块的鸡尾酒调酒器中，剧烈摇晃，然后倒入气球玻璃杯中，加入柠檬水，并用一块橙子装饰。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Mettere il Bombay Sapphire, il Martini Bianco, lo sciroppo di zucchero e le more in uno shaker con molto ghiaccio e agitare energicamente prima di versare in un bicchiere a palloncino, rabboccare con limonata e guarnire con uno spicchio di arancia.", :strMeasure2 "15 ml", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-11-01 17:18:32", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Cocktail", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Maraschino Cherry", :strMeasure4 "100 ml", :strMeasure5 "2", :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Balloon Glass", :strInstructionsDE "Den Bombay Saphir, Martini Bianco, Zuckersirup & Brombeeren in einen Cocktailshaker mit viel Eis geben und kräftig schütteln, bevor man sie in ein Ballonglas gießt, mit Limonade auffüllt und mit einem Stück Orange garniert.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Sugar Syrup", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "Cloves", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Verser le jus de cerise, l'écorce d'orange, le piment, les bâtons de cannelle, les clous de girofle et le gingembre dans une grande casserole. Laisser mijoter pendant 5 minutes, puis éteindre le feu. Laissez refroidir, puis mettez au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 4 heures, ou jusqu'à 2 jours - plus vous le laissez longtemps, plus les saveurs seront intenses. Si vous le servez à de jeunes enfants, retirez le piment après quelques heures.\r\n\r\nAu moment de servir, versez le jus dans une carafe. Servez dans des bouteilles ou des verres en verre et mettez une paille dans chacun d'eux. Si vous ajoutez de la vodka, faites-le à ce stade. Suspendez un bonbon à crocs dans chaque verre.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Tip the cherry juice, orange peel, chilli, cinnamon sticks, cloves and ginger into a large saucepan. Simmer for 5 mins, then turn off the heat. Leave to cool, then chill for at least 4 hrs, or up to 2 days – the longer you leave it the more intense the flavours. If serving to young children, take the chilli out after a few hours.\r\n\r\nWhen you’re ready to serve, pour the juice into a jug. Serve in glass bottles or glasses and pop a straw in each. If you're adding vodka, do so at this stage. Dangle a fangs sweet from each glass.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags "Halloween", :strMeasure1 "1 bottle", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 "Ginger", :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Halloween Punch", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/7hcgyj1571687671.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1", :strInstructionsES "Poner en un cazo grande el zumo de cereza, la piel de naranja, la guindilla, la canela en rama, el clavo y el jengibre. Cocer a fuego lento durante 5 minutos y apagar el fuego. Déjelo enfriar y póngalo a enfriar durante al menos 4 horas, o hasta 2 días; cuanto más tiempo lo deje, más intensos serán los sabores. Si se sirve a niños pequeños, retire la guindilla al cabo de unas horas.\r\n\r\nCuando esté listo para servir, vierta el zumo en una jarra. Sírvalo en botellas o vasos de cristal y coloque una pajita en cada uno. Si va a añadir vodka, hágalo en este momento. Cuelga un colmillo dulce de cada vaso.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Cherry Juice", :idDrink "178313", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將櫻桃汁、橙皮、辣椒、肉桂棒、丁香和生薑倒入大平底鍋中。煮5分鐘，然後關火。待冷卻，然後冷藏至少 4 小時，或最多 2 天 - 放置時間越長，味道越濃鬱。如果給小朋友吃，幾個小時後就把辣椒拿出來。\r\n\r\n準備好食用時，將果汁倒入壺中。裝在玻璃瓶或玻璃杯中，並在每個玻璃瓶或玻璃杯中插入一根吸管。如果您要添加伏特加，請在這個階段添加。每個玻璃杯上都掛著一顆尖牙。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将樱桃汁、橙皮、辣椒、肉桂棒、丁香和生姜倒入一个大平底锅中。煮5分钟，然后关火。待冷却，然后冷藏至少 4 小时，或最多 2 天 - 放置时间越长，味道越浓郁。如果给小孩子吃，几个小时后就把辣椒拿出来。\r\n\r\n准备好食用时，将果汁倒入壶中。装在玻璃瓶或玻璃杯中，并在每个玻璃瓶或玻璃杯中插入一根吸管。如果您要添加伏特加，请在这个阶段添加。每个玻璃杯上都挂着一颗尖牙。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 "", :strInstructionsIT "Versare il succo di ciliegia, la buccia d'arancia, il peperoncino, i bastoncini di cannella, i chiodi di garofano e lo zenzero in una grande casseruola. Cuocere a fuoco lento per 5 minuti, quindi spegnere il fuoco. Raffreddare per almeno 4 ore o fino a 2 giorni: più a lungo lo lasci, più intensi sono i sapori. Se servi ai bambini piccoli, togli il peperoncino dopo alcune ore.\r\n\r\nQuando sei pronto per servire, versa il succo in una caraffa. Servire in bottiglie o bicchieri di vetro e inserire una cannuccia in ciascuno. Se stai aggiungendo la vodka, fallo in questa fase. Fai ciondolare una zanna dolce da ogni bicchiere.", :strMeasure2 "3", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified nil, :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Punch / Party Drink", :strMeasure6 "20 cl", :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Orange Peel", :strMeasure4 "10", :strMeasure5 "6", :strIngredient6 "Vodka", :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Punch bowl", :strInstructionsDE nil, :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Red Chili Flakes", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Dans un shaker à moitié rempli de glaçons, mélanger tous les ingrédients. Bien agiter. Filtrer dans un verre à cocktail.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "In a shaker half-filled with ice cubes, combine all of the ingredients. Shake well. Strain into a cocktail glass.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "1 oz ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Havana Cocktail", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/59splc1504882899.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1 tsp ", :strInstructionsES "En una coctelera llena hasta la mitad con cubitos de hielo, mezcle todos los ingredientes. Agitar bien. Colar en una copa de cóctel.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Light rum", :idDrink "11470", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "在裝有半杯冰塊的搖酒壺中，混合所有成分。搖勻。濾入雞尾酒杯。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "在装有半杯冰块的摇酒壶中，混合所有成分。摇匀。滤入鸡尾酒杯。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "In uno shaker riempito a metà con cubetti di ghiaccio, unire tutti gli ingredienti.Agitare bene.Filtrare in un bicchiere da cocktail.", :strMeasure2 "1 oz ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-09-08 16:01:40", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Ordinary Drink", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Pineapple juice", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Cocktail glass", :strInstructionsDE "In einem Shaker, der halb mit Eiswürfel gefüllt ist, alle Zutaten vermengen. Gut schütteln. In ein Cocktailglas abseihen.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Lemon juice", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "Sherbet", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Prenez un paquet de jus de raisin et un paquet de boissons gazeuses (club soda, ginger ale, lemonlime, etc.). Mélangez-les dans un bol à punch. Prenez du sorbet à l'orange et du sorbet au citron vert. Prélevez des boules et faites-les flotter dans le punch, laissez-les fondre un peu pour qu'une pellicule désagréable s'étende sur le dessus du punch mais qu'il y ait encore des \"bulles\" sous la forme de boules de sorbet. L'aspect est horrible, mais le goût est excellent.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Take a bunch of grape juice and a bunch of fizzy stuff (club soda, ginger ale, lemonlime, whatever). Mix them in a punch bowl. Take orange sherbet and lime sherbet. Scoop out scoops and float them in the punch, let them melt a little so that a nasty film spreads all over the top of the punch but there are still \"bubbles\" in it in the form of sherbet scoops. Looks horrible, tastes just fine.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 nil, :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Holloween Punch", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/lfeoe41504888925.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 nil, :strInstructionsES "Coge un montón de zumo de uva y un montón de bebidas gaseosas (club soda, ginger ale, lima, lo que sea). Mézclalos en una ponchera. Coge sorbete de naranja y sorbete de lima. Saca cucharadas y ponlas a flotar en el ponche, deja que se derritan un poco para que se extienda una película desagradable por toda la parte superior del ponche, pero sigue habiendo \"burbujas\" en forma de cucharadas de sorbete. Tiene un aspecto horrible, pero sabe muy bien.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Grape juice", :idDrink "12954", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "拿一堆葡萄汁和一堆碳酸飲料（蘇打水、薑汁汽水、檸檬酸橙等等）。將它們混合在潘趣酒碗中。服用橙子果子露和酸橙果子露。舀出勺子，將它們漂浮在沖床中，讓它們稍微融化，這樣一層令人討厭的薄膜就會遍布沖床的頂部，但其中仍然有果子露勺形式的「氣泡」。看起來很可怕，味道卻還不錯。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "拿一堆葡萄汁和一堆碳酸饮料（苏打水、姜汁汽水、柠檬酸橙等等）。将它们混合在潘趣酒碗中。服用橙子果子露和酸橙果子露。舀出勺子，将它们漂浮在冲床中，让它们稍微融化，这样一层令人讨厌的薄膜就会遍布冲床的顶部，但其中仍然有果子露勺形式的“气泡”。看起来很可怕，味道却还不错。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Prendi un mazzetto di succo d'uva e un po 'di roba frizzante (club soda, ginger ale, sprite, qualunque cosa).\r\nMescolali in una ciotola da punch.\r\nPrendi il sorbetto all'arancia e il sorbetto al lime.\r\nEstrarre le palette e farle galleggiare nel punch, lasciarle sciogliere un po 'in modo che una pellicola sgradevole si diffonda su tutta la parte superiore del punch ma ci siano ancora delle \"bolle\" sotto forma di palline di sorbetto.\r\nSembra orribile, ha un buon sapore.", :strMeasure2 ", orange\n", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-09-08 17:42:05", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Punch / Party Drink", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Carbonated soft drink", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Punch bowl", :strInstructionsDE "Nimm viel Traubensaft und kohlensäurehaltige Flüssigkeiten (Club-Soda, Ginger Ale, Zitronenlimonade, was auch immer). In einer Bowle mischen. Nehmen Sie Orangenbrause und Limettenbrause. Bläschen im Punsch schweben lassen, sie ein wenig zergehen lassen, so dass sich ein böser Film über die Oberseite des Punschs verteilt, aber es gibt immer noch \"Blasen\" in Form von Brause-Schälchen darin. Sieht schrecklich aus, schmeckt gut.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Sherbet", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Non alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "Vanilla extract", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Dissoudre le sucre dans 2 tasses d'eau bouillante et ajouter le sirop de maïs. Dissoudre le café instantané dans le reste de l'eau. Verser le sirop et le café dans un pot de gallon. Laisser refroidir. Ajouter la vodka et la vanille lorsqu'elle est froide. Pour un résultat optimal, laissez le mélange \"mûrir\" pendant 4 à 5 semaines.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Dissolve sugar in 2 cups of boiling water and add corn syrup. Dissolve the instant coffee in the remaining water. Pour syrup and coffee in a gallon jug. Let it cool. Add vodka and vanilla when cold. For the best result, let the mixture \"mature\" for 4-5 weeks.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "2 1/2 cups ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 "Water", :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Homemade Kahlua", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/uwtsst1441254025.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1 1/2 oz instant ", :strInstructionsES "Disolver el azúcar en 2 tazas de agua hirviendo y añadir el jarabe de maíz. Disuelva el café instantáneo en el agua restante. Vierta el jarabe y el café en una jarra de un galón. Dejar enfriar. Añada el vodka y la vainilla cuando esté frío. Para obtener el mejor resultado, deja que la mezcla \"madure\" durante 4-5 semanas.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Sugar", :idDrink "17044", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將糖溶解在 2 杯沸水中，然後加入玉米糖漿。將即溶咖啡溶解在剩餘的水中。將糖漿和咖啡倒入一加侖壺中。讓它冷卻。冷後加入伏特加和香草。為了獲得最佳效果，讓混合物「熟化」4-5 週。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将糖溶解在 2 杯沸水中，然后加入玉米糖浆。将速溶咖啡溶解在剩余的水中。将糖浆和咖啡倒入一加仑壶中。让它冷却。冷后加入伏特加和香草。为了获得最佳效果，让混合物“熟化”4-5 周。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Sciogliere lo zucchero in 2 tazze di acqua bollente e aggiungere lo sciroppo di mais.\r\nSciogliere il caffè solubile nell'acqua rimasta.\r\nVersare lo sciroppo e il caffè in una brocca da un gallone.\r\nLascialo raffreddare.\r\nAggiungere la vodka e la vaniglia quando sono fredde.\r\nPer il miglior risultato lasciare \"maturare\" la miscela per 4-5 settimane.", :strMeasure2 "1 cup ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2015-09-03 05:20:25", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Homemade Liqueur", :strMeasure6 "1 fifth ", :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Corn syrup", :strMeasure4 "2 oz ", :strMeasure5 "3 cups boiling ", :strIngredient6 "Vodka", :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Collins Glass", :strInstructionsDE "Zucker in 2 Tassen kochendem Wasser auflösen und Maissirup hinzufügen. Lösen Sie den Instantkaffee in dem verbleibenden Wasser auf. Geben Sie Sirup und Kaffee in eine Kanne. Abkühlen lassen. Fügen Sie Wodka und Vanille hinzu, wenn sie kalt sind. Für das beste Ergebnis lassen Sie die Mischung 4-5 Wochen \"reifen\".", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Coffee", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Mélanger tous les ingrédients dans un verre", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Combine all ingredients in glass", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags nil, :strMeasure1 "1 shot ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Hot Creamy Bush", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/spvrtp1472668037.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "6 oz hot ", :strInstructionsES "Combina todos los ingredientes en un vaso.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA nil, :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Irish whiskey", :idDrink "14782", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將所有成分混合在玻璃杯中", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将所有成分混合在玻璃杯中", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Unisci tutti gli ingredienti in un bicchiere", :strMeasure2 "3/4 shot ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2016-08-31 19:27:17", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Coffee / Tea", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Baileys irish cream", :strMeasure4 nil, :strMeasure5 nil, :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Irish coffee cup", :strInstructionsDE "Alle Zutaten in einem Glas vermengen.", :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Coffee", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 nil, :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Remuez la vodka et le jus d'orange avec de la glace dans le verre, puis faites flotter le Galliano sur le dessus. Décorez et servez.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Stir the vodka and orange juice with ice in the glass, then float the Galliano on top. Garnish and serve.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags "IBA,ContemporaryClassic", :strMeasure1 "1 oz ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 nil, :strImageAttribution "rawpixel.com", :strDrink "Harvey Wallbanger", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/7os4gs1606854357.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "4 oz ", :strInstructionsES "Mezcle el vodka y el zumo de naranja con hielo en el vaso y, a continuación, deje flotar el Galliano por encima. Decorar y servir.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA "Contemporary Classics", :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Vodka", :idDrink "11462", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將伏特加和柳橙汁與冰塊一起放入玻璃杯中攪拌，然後將加利亞諾浮在上面。裝飾並上菜。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将伏特加和橙汁与冰块一起放入玻璃杯中搅拌，然后将加利亚诺浮在上面。装饰并上菜。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 nil, :strInstructionsIT "Mescolare la vodka e il succo d'arancia con ghiaccio nel bicchiere, successivamente versa nel drink il Galliano. Guarnire e servire.", :strMeasure2 "1/2 oz ", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified "2017-09-02 17:28:45", :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Ordinary Drink", :strMeasure6 nil, :strMe