ur", :idDrink "178335", :strInstructionsZH-HANT "將椰子利口酒（最好是龍舌蘭酒）與葡萄柚汁混合，然後加入蘇打水。用一大片葡萄柚片裝飾在玻璃杯內側。", :strInstructionsZH-HANS "将椰子利口酒（最好是龙舌兰酒）与葡萄柚汁混合，然后加入苏打水。用一大片葡萄柚片装饰在玻璃杯内侧。", :strMeasure9 nil, :strMeasure7 "", :strInstructionsIT "Mescolare il liquore al cocco (preferibilmente tequila) con il succo di pompelmo e guarnire con acqua di seltz. Versare una grossa fetta di pompelmo dentro il bicchiere.", :strMeasure2 "75 ml", :strMeasure12 nil, :strMeasure10 nil, :dateModified nil, :strMeasure8 nil, :strCategory "Cocktail", :strMeasure6 "", :strMeasure14 nil, :strIngredient2 "Grapefruit Juice", :strMeasure4 "", :strMeasure5 "", :strIngredient6 nil, :strImageSource nil, :strIngredient8 nil, :strGlass "Highball glass", :strInstructionsDE nil, :strDrinkAlternate nil, :strIngredient3 "Soda Water", :strCreativeCommonsConfirmed "No", :strAlcoholic "Alcoholic", :strIngredient14 nil} {:strIngredient4 "Gin", :strMeasure11 nil, :strInstructionsFR "Mélanger le tout dans un verre à cocktail et laisser reposer doucement. Ajouter un trait de Coca-Cola pour la coloration et garnir d'un zeste de citron ou de citron vert.", :strVideo nil, :strInstructions "Mix all contents in a highball glass and sitr gently. Add dash of Coca-Cola for the coloring and garnish with lemon or lime twist.", :strIngredient10 nil, :strMeasure13 nil, :strIngredient12 nil, :strTags "IBA,ContemporaryClassic", :strMeasure1 "1/2 oz ", :strIngredient9 nil, :strIngredient13 nil, :strIngredient5 "Coca-Cola", :strImageAttribution nil, :strDrink "Long Island Iced Tea", :strDrinkThumb "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/wx7hsg1504370510.jpg", :strMeasure15 nil, :strIngredient7 nil, :strMeasure3 "1/2 oz ", :strInstructionsES "Mezcle todo el contenido en un vaso highball y siéntelo suavemente. Añada un chorrito de Coca-Cola para dar color y decore con un twist de limón o lima.", :strIngredient15 nil, :strIBA "Contemporary Classics", :strIngredient11 nil, :strIngredient1 "Vodka", :idDrink "17204", :strInstruct